'''Hearts''' is a [[Common Weapons|common]] knife that was originally obtainable by purchasing it for 75 [[coins]]{{Currency|Old Coin}} during the [[Valentines Event 2016|2016 Valentines Event]]. It is now only obtainable through trading as the event has since ended.

== Appearance ==
Its blade appears to consist of a gradient, starting at a dark purple at the tip, and ending in a solid black. Scattered along the blade are purple hearts, varying in opacity and sizes. The guard is golden, and the handle is solid black.

== Trivia ==
*Hearts is fourth of the six knives included in the [[Murder Mystery 2 Wiki:Wiki-Bot/Valentine Set|Valentine Set]], the others being [[Roses]], [[Passion]], [[Valentine]], [[Blossom (2016)|Blossom]] and [[Sweetheart]].

